IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. REQUESTCHECK.
DATA DIVISION.
LINKAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-STATE PIC X(8).
01 OUTPUT-DECISION PIC X(4).
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING INPUT-STATE OUTPUT-DECISION.
    IF INPUT-STATE = 'PENDING'
        MOVE 'WORK' TO OUTPUT-DECISION
    ELSE
        MOVE 'SKIP' TO OUTPUT-DECISION
    END-IF.
    GOBACK.
